menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_WAKE_FEEDBACK
    bool "Enable wake feedback"
    default y
    depends on FEATURE_VOICE_WAKE
    help
        Turn one accepted local wake event into immediate device feedback:
        play the short wake cue, show the listening indicator, and record the
        bounded wake interaction event for the next authenticated heartbeat.
        Raw audio and wake confidence are not persisted.

endmenu
